<title>USA: Philips sells plant to Circuit.</title>
<headline>Philips sells plant to Circuit.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV's Philips Consumer Electronics Co said Friday it sold its printed circuit board manufacturing plant located in Greeneville, Tennesee, to Circuit Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Philips said Circuit Systems Inc will assume ownership of the plant and will begin operations effective July 28.</p>
<p>Philips did not disclose financial information on the sale of the plant.</p>
<p>Philips Consumer Electronics Co designs, makes and sells Philips Magnavox consumer, professional and commercial electronics products.</p>
